from · foreigner · it(acc.) · again · you(fam.sg.) · exact{debt}(prs.,possib.), · but · that · which · thy-own · with · thy-brother · be(prs.) · thine-hand · release(fut.),
Analysis: from kjv_foreigner it:a again thou kjv_exact_debt:pr:may, but that which thy/own with thy/brother be:pr thine/hand release:fu,
